stateDiagram-v2

%% The same job runner, revealed a step at a time.
%% All three of this kind's timeline targets are named below: a state, a
%% transition, and a composite frame — the frame under the author's own
%% name, because a composite state is named by its author.

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Working : start

state Working {
  Fetching --> Saving
}

Working --> Done : finished
Done --> [*]

timeline:
  enter Idle fade
  enter Idle-Working fade, enter Working slide-top
  enter Fetching fade, enter Saving fade, enter Fetching-Saving fade
  highlight Working outline
  enter Working-Done fade, enter Done slide-right, unhighlight Working
  highlight Idle-Working glow, enter Done-end:1 fade
  unhighlight Idle-Working, exit Idle slide-left, exit start:1-Idle slide-left, exit Idle-Working slide-left
